                  "startLine": 8
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Public contact intake permits unbounded database and notification amplification\n\nEvery unauthenticated request can create a service-role contact row and one attacker-controlled notification per active administrator without rate limiting, bot proof, or deduplication.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-770\n\nRemediation:\nAdd edge rate limits, bot challenges, burst/deduplication controls, and monitoring before service-role work. Revoke direct public table INSERT and funnel submissions through the controlled endpoint; aggregate admin notifications."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:f71ffcc973134a48bd70a39be4a8fdcda9eab862e215084e5a02883a54e6b341",
            "primaryLocationLineHash": "e680b3eca83179dd:1"
          },
